cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WHISPER-CBPF in your research, please cite it."
title: "WHISPER-CBPF: Bayesian model comparison of transient light curves"
abstract: >-
  WHISPER-CBPF is an open-source, extensible Python toolkit for Bayesian model comparison of
  astronomical transient light curves: load photometry or LSST and ZTF alerts, fit candidate
  models with pluggable samplers (ABC, ABC-SMC, MCMC, nested sampling, NUTS and SNPE, on CPU or
  GPU), and obtain posteriors, model-selection metrics (AIC, BIC, WAIC, PSIS-LOO, ln Z) and a
  ranked, checked comparison of the models.
type: software
authors:
